      "description": {
        "fun": "A mischievous, mask-wearing ogre that Kitakami's legends paint as a villain, though it's really the hero of the tale. It's curious about people, slipping into the Festival of Masks in disguise and pinching snacks from town. Each of its four masks changes its type, and when it Terastallizes a giant crystal copy of the mask floats in front of it. Its orange face may be modelled on a dekopon.",
        "guide": "A Grass-type Legendary Pokémon and the mascot of The Teal Mask, designed by Hitoshi Ariga and based on the oni of Japanese folklore. It has four forms, one for each mask it wears: the Teal Mask, Wellspring Mask (Water), Hearthflame Mask (Fire) and Cornerstone Mask (Rock).",
        "tagline": "A mischievous mask-wearing ogre who's secretly the hero",
